## Grand Central first layout

```text
P1 Circle Line clockwise
P2 Circle Line anticlockwise
P3 Eastern Line outbound
P4 Eastern Line inbound
P5 Central/New Egypt line or ACME electric work-in-progress
P6 private/express/future platform
```

## Display types

Station Sign: station name, lines, rolling banner.
Departures: concourse/main hall upcoming trains.
Platform Board: next train and calling points for one platform.
Tube Map: static MCNet map with the current station highlighted.

